GPL-2.0-or-later, a test-only change to QEMU; not part of AfriSovera
TEST EQUIPMENT ONLY (13 Nov 2026, UVC plan, architect's Q3): a USB Video Class test camera for QEMU
(usb-uvc-test), applied to QEMU's own source when the CI builds QEMU (ci.yml, cloud/job.sh), never part of
AfriSovera. QEMU 11 has no USB camera, so this is the weaker kind of evidence, because the same engineer wrote
both ends; pc-usbcam grades it together with the driver's selftest built from the UVC 1.5 specification.
No other QEMU device changes.

